{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1000_p", "source_sha256": "013b05084c84ae82466551a924c756ee1ddaf799c7d1f50ad7d57ca5b607f2fa", "ja": "（ジュリアに、次の公演の話をしようと思ってきたけど\n……なんだか盛り上がってるみたいだな）", "zh": "（我打算和茱莉亚谈谈下次公演的事……\n但她们似乎讨论得很热烈。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ad77fb1b4e30e84fb5225b9f9998e97529aed8d718e2227128f7b15f2772d86b", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n随分楽しそうだけど、何の話をしてたんだ？", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n你们看起来聊得很开心呢，在讨论什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "0ea9d817d14a7ba597351bdf76645dbfee1971ad8f069dde61e873b7da77b50a", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょうどいいところに！\n実は今、みんなとロックの話をしてたんだ。", "zh": "{$P$}，你来得正好！\n其实我们刚刚在聊摇滚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "3d5c3cab3c30da402fa956eef5f619fcca287ca0c4865f504ca44c3b627e43d0", "ja": "どうしたら琴葉ちゃんの魂を\nザクザクーって刻めるか、考えてたんですよ！", "zh": "我们正在想要怎样才能\n把小琴叶的灵魂烙出一个洞一个洞的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "0cea9c3c349beffa767783d972b5689492318b219ecfbbb742a51f6a434acd71", "ja": "ち、違いますよ麗花さん！　ジュリアちゃんは、\n魂にロックを刻んでほしいと言っただけで……。", "zh": "不、不是啦，丽花姊！\n茱莉亚只是说希望在我的灵魂中留下摇滚的烙印而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "040a62793a3a184babccdbd3bc34d9012a5cb94563661469843ab5433c465956", "ja": "はは、そういうコト。レイと琴葉が、ロックに\n興味を持ってくれたみたいだったからさ♪", "zh": "哈哈，就是这么回事。\n因为丽和琴叶好像对摇滚有点兴趣呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4c0d5362920c9a71da3800a2f17249c719d7dba431f7034ef7e200d2a7fb2fbd", "ja": "ロックについてか……。\nジュリアに語らせたら、長くなりそうだな！", "zh": "摇滚的话题啊……\n茱莉亚聊起这个，感觉会聊上很久呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "2b6eb0973cad0a3d03030fff9ff40ca25d9af3ba6853e5c2228417a6e7704e9f", "ja": "おっと。誤解すんなよ{$P$}？\n長ったらしい能書きは、あたしの趣味じゃない。", "zh": "唉呀，你可别误会啊，{$P$}，\n我可不喜欢长篇大论地自卖自夸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "69570c8f8c57c98446910a26114bd7ad53dde2c9f43a3f7e1ccc920715499fe2", "ja": "ロックは魂なんだ。あたしは、思いを歌に乗せるだけ。\nそれが観客に響いて、初めて魂と魂が共鳴するんだ。", "zh": "摇滚是一种灵魂，我只是把心意灌注在歌曲上而已。\n如果这份心意打动了观众，灵魂之间才会真正产生共鸣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "fcf95165653cef845f7883bbba9d8689f3bd839ca81f66c92406dc213193f7de", "ja": "そして、ステージと会場が一気に燃え上がる！\n……それがあたしにとっての、ロックってヤツだな！", "zh": "然后舞台和会场就会一瞬间沸腾起来！\n……对我来说，这就是摇滚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "c6ce0e5aae9583cab855c1238b26298537ff356aad30745950a276d66bc54f8f", "ja": "なんだか、すっごく楽しそう！　ジュリアちゃん、\n地元にいたころはバンドをやってたんだよね？", "zh": "听起来好好玩！\n小茱莉亚，你在老家时有组乐团对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "22c7c2652b638efeedb90bb28e2ea4ab939452ed313f9819b9e1ce33196dca57", "ja": "ああ！　この劇場より小さいライブハウスだったけど、\nけっこう盛り上がってたし、楽しかったよ。", "zh": "对啊！虽然只在比这座剧场还小的Live house\n演唱，但气氛还挺热烈的，也很开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "c335d3d58429469045b7507daec999d3fa23ef4af2ff552d6668336a39f56c2c", "ja": "こうして話してると、なんだか懐かしい感じがするな。\n久しぶりに、あの興奮を味わいたいよ……。", "zh": "说着说着就怀念起那时候了呢。\n隔了这么久，真想回味一下那种兴奋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1013_p", "source_sha256": "263470580cf8508e0ed70da5bde66a44e081e9f6e6c431a5f4bf56af7d7ca4d5", "ja": "バンドの興奮とは、ちょっと違うかもしれないけど……\nジュリア、次の定期公演でセンターをやってみないか？", "zh": "虽然可能跟乐团的兴奋不太一样……不过，茱莉亚，\n下次的定期公演你要不要挑战当Center？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "2e8725ea03fee36ff3ef7b984f8c6826db4a8ad8f5b0c6b21dd1bae7232ef400", "ja": "せ……センター！？　って、あたしが！？\nマジか！", "zh": "Cen……Center！？我吗！？\n真的假的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6745e26878188ce9b9ab85932e38b4022b1b85ff7a9f98d2d460b0cea16241df", "ja": "もちろん、マジだ！　どんなステージにするかは、\nジュリアに任せる。思いっきり暴れてもいいぞ！", "zh": "当然是真的！至于要带来什么样的表演就由你自己决定，\n也可以豁出去尽量疯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "695b1fb567fde49c9c256d6606bc9ba11d9bf4d58c3a6ea980ffa23e3e1f009b", "ja": "あたしの好きに……。", "zh": "随我决定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "45c0a0bd96712e4e90347c52006265f3a749bdfd85a5219dcb1eca03916c279e", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん、どうかした？", "zh": "茱莉亚，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "264cd87a0e1eb448db3efdcadcad0444ee23081d7ee9650df725af2a576376ae", "ja": "え？　ああ、いや。なんでもない。\n……{$P$}。やるよ、センター！", "zh": "咦？喔喔，不，没什么。\n……{$P$}，我要当Center！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1019_p", "source_sha256": "304f5e465296a5ba4eb26e4f38b088acac31bcc4fe5871b6e6600679df039874", "ja": "引き受けてくれるか。", "zh": "你愿意接下这个位置吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "7b7781cffdbc58589268cde9a72d05e5cf86937b72cf2f49071d0da6cb042fa5", "ja": "もちろんだ！\n最高のステージにしてやるぜ！", "zh": "当然！\n我一定会完成最棒的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "03b30ac8cf60d40251fc402fcaffd0a9b4c3b09abdf85e937349abc0a9864e69", "ja": "わぁ、おめでとうジュリアちゃん♪\nセンターか～、いいな～。", "zh": "哇～小茱莉亚，恭喜你♪\nCenter啊～好好喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "5ca2df89cfeb104d47782cb703ab1378d809dabfbd997870e4db2ac73839999c", "ja": "いや、レイはもうやっただろ、センター……。", "zh": "好什么好，丽你已经当过Center了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "9ea8447229d078bab100fc937b184545e5ba1c2aadba04c027f1cc3d3a14e8fb", "ja": "でもでも、ジュリアちゃんと一緒に、\nロボットダンスやりたいなーって♪", "zh": "但是我好想跟小茱莉亚一起跳机械舞喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "2c15a704abc94c03902ac725f4c9bce4174a27ac529ad9ba54938437d600c605", "ja": "は？　ロボットダンス？\nなんでロボットダンスなんだよ。", "zh": "什么？机械舞？\n为什么要跳机械舞啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "c4f100229224348f7c86841f93152a1deefd4e5e27b22e998a26df36c3e760c6", "ja": "だってジュリアちゃん、さっきからカクカクしてるよ？\nロボットダンスがやりたいんじゃないの？", "zh": "因为小茱莉亚从刚刚到现在一直都在颤抖啊，\n不就是因为想跳机械舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "fe342a6ec6d284f78e27359568467d2f7c02487e186862a690d64eee409b9c1f", "ja": "言われてみれば……\nもしかしてジュリアちゃん、緊張してる？", "zh": "听你这么一说……\n茱莉亚，你该不会很紧张吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "fe6c6c8b1d1e9ee4c02de92c669eef091ba3e8fd6893552ea8f6271de00ae149", "ja": "ち、違うっって！\nあたしは別に、緊張してるわけじゃ……くぅ。", "zh": "才、才没有呢！\n我才不会紧张……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "b170e3346c0972280a1cbcb9e85edac45be05b0e6fbe008250b8cbf9fd8496b3", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\nよかったら私にも、公演を手伝わせてもらえませんか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}，\n方便的话，可以让我一起协助公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "fd939627d01da8f3106870207866602f1e2257ec45eedbbf00a4dc065ba7e52f", "ja": "はーい！　私も私も！\nジュリアちゃんの公演、協力するする！", "zh": "对啊！我也要我也要！\n我也要在小茱莉亚的公演上帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ba38a103d02bfdb66fb6e5e622837bcaea598520e71e8e99c02500fdab9d5353", "ja": "もちろん！　琴葉と麗花がステージにいてくれたら、\nジュリアも心強いだろうしな。よろしく頼むよ。", "zh": "当然好！要是能和琴叶及丽花一起上台，\n茱莉亚一定也会比较安心，那就拜托你们啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "fe42a364e9e3e4dd58aa336c4c66375fe89bd99183e63351686824f3c4f49246", "ja": "そのとおり～！！", "zh": "说得没错～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1032_047sub", "source_sha256": "fe42a364e9e3e4dd58aa336c4c66375fe89bd99183e63351686824f3c4f49246", "ja": "そのとおり～！！", "zh": "说得没错～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "2648d4276c219b4488e42d97d3b51344be5a37db3042338c7f392e8ea0c39f24", "ja": "うわっ！？\n……のり子、それに昴？", "zh": "唔哇！？\n……法子和昴？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1034_047sub", "source_sha256": "20da55bf006f9027be7ace5313e26f70d400098f759745a172d12467f34a1e4a", "ja": "話は聞いたぜ！　アドバイスなら、オレにまかせろ！\nどんな質問にも、経験者としてズバッと答えてやるぜ！", "zh": "我们都听到了！需要建议就交给我吧！\n不管什么问题，我都会以过来人的身分马上解答！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "c3d0ca73a0cc89ebdbba3501406e91ea59372b8465ee027e28b313837d152594", "ja": "ノーノー！　ここは経験者であると同時に、\n人生の先輩でもあるアタシの出番でしょ！", "zh": "不不不！这里应该轮到既当过Center，\n又是人生前辈的我出场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_041_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "9cbac1eb9c67738a3d73aed1f882de6c186a0c74d0a3515877812610599188bd", "ja": "あれあれ？　経験者で人生の先輩ってことは……\n私が一番えらい、ってことでいいのかな？", "zh": "咦咦？如果要说当过Center、又是人生前辈……\n在座的第一顺位应该是我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
